        {
          "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/notes/2",
          "type": "AnnotationPage",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/note/4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Drag the Queue into the right order</h3><p>Arrange the items in the sequence the audience should see. Remove outdated items. Use an item&#x27;s Show now when something needs the screen immediately.</p><p>The running order matches your event or venue.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Build a Digital Signage Playlist on TV Without a New Media Player</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Choose manual play, Auto and Loop</h3><p>Use Play queue for manual progression. Turn Auto on for automatic advance, set Seconds per item and enable Loop when the sequence should repeat.</p><p>The display follows your chosen playback pattern.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Build a Digital Signage Playlist on TV Without a New Media Player</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Preview the whole sequence</h3><p>Watch the transitions. Slideshows and countdowns can hold Auto until their own finish; ordinary items use the Queue timing. The display continues until the V U This session ends.</p><p>The screen is ready for the audience.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Build a Digital Signage Playlist on TV Without a New Media Player</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-digital-signage-playlist.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            }
          ]
